login (bare CR first) and sent its exit preamble even after a failed login, so /dev/u2's
`login:` received stray usernames (3 × `Login incorrect`). No command reached a CLI. The wrapper
was rewritten with a prompt-driven login (/tmp/ck33234/ckcon.py, tmpfs).

